                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Alright, so I had originally gave this game a positive review since I thought development of this game continued, but seeing as how the game is clearly unfinished, and the last update made was nearly a year ago, I'm pretty certain this game has been abandoned. The game doesn't proceed to Chapter 2, gameplay is mediocre at best, and the enemies take way too many hits to go down. I can't recommend this. It has been abandoned, and I doubt the devs have any intention as to return to it.",
